  "notes": "DOUBT: scdhhs.gov returns HTTP 403 (CloudFront block) to this network and to WebFetch, so the official XLSX was obtained from an unaltered Wayback capture (2025-09-01) of the official URL; it could not be confirmed that this is still the latest edition on 2026-10-20. A search-engine snippet of an SCDHHS payment-rate transparency PDF (https://www.scdhhs.gov/sites/dhhs/files/Dental%20Services.pdf) shows D0120 child 28.00 / adult 23.00 effective 7/1/2026, matching this file, so rates appear unchanged, but that PDF could not be downloaded to verify other codes. Columns: 'Children & ID/RD Waiver Preventive Dental Benefit - Rate set 7/1/2024' -> child (under 21, and ID/RD waiver adults); 'Adult - Adult Preventive Dental Benefit Implemented 12/1/2014' -> adult (adult benefit capped annually per SC policy). 'Not Covered'/'n/a' -> not_covered_child/adult. A third column 'Emergency & Exceptional Medical Conditions Services' says D0120-D9999 'By Report' unless a fee is listed (not recorded per code). Crowns D2740-D2790, perio D4341-D4910, implants, ortho D8xxx are not listed in this schedule. Adult values kept with the decimals printed in the file (e.g. D0210 50.0926).",
