  "notes_2024": "Edition 'DENTAL PROVIDERS FEE SCHEDULE - Schedule updated 7/1/2024' (child rates 'Rate set 7/1/2024', i.e. the July 1, 2024 children's rate increase per the 2024-06-13 SCDHHS dental rates notice). It is the edition effective exactly on 2024-07-01; an earlier copy of the same file was captured by Wayback on 2024-07-02 ('Copy of Dental Fee schedule 7.1.2024.xlsx'). Note: if the ADA July-2024 data were collected before the 7/1/2024 increase took effect, the pre-increase (1/1/2023) child rates would apply instead - not retrieved. All requested-code values are identical to the 1/1/2025 edition."
